{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.OcneanuTrace","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.crossTerm_neg_convD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.crossTerm_neg_convD","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L148-L162","doc":"**The cross term is strictly negative at convention D for every real `q > 0`:** the\ninterleaved trace is smaller than the per-bond product, so an interleaved word class carries\nextra log-suppression (extra binding). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.markovDefect_convD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.markovDefect_convD","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L140-L146","doc":"The convention-D Markov defect `z² − h z − 1` at `z = q³/(q²+1)`, `h = q − q⁻¹`, in closed\nform: `−(q⁴+q²+1)/(q²+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.interleaved_sub_sequential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.interleaved_sub_sequential","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L126-L134","doc":"**THE CROSS TERM.** The interleaved word and the per-bond product differ by exactly\n`z (z² − h z − 1)`. The product formula is not exact at `n = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_sequential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_sequential","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L114-L124","doc":"**The sequential (per-bond product) word.** `tr(g₀² g₁² g₂) = z (h z + 1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_interleaved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_interleaved","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L98-L112","doc":"**The interleaved word.** `tr(g₀ g₁ g₀ g₂ g₁) = z (z² + h z + h² z²)`: rotate the trailing\n`g₁` to the front (trace property), peel `g₂` (Markov), then the `H₃` word above. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g1_g0_g1_g0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g1_g0_g1_g0","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L88-L96","doc":"`tr(g₁ g₀ g₁ g₀) = h·z(hz+1) + z²` via the braid relation and the Hecke quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_g1_g0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_g1_g0","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L83-L86","doc":"**The `n = 3` identity of `qou-ls86`:** `tr(g₀ g₁ g₀) = tr(g₀² g₁)` by cyclicity alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0sq_g1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0sq_g1","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L77-L81","doc":"`tr(g₀² g₁) = z (h z + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_sq","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L72-L75","doc":"`tr(g₀²) = h z + 1` from the Hecke quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_g1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0_g1","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L68-L70","doc":"`tr(g₀ g₁) = z²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedCrossTerm.tr_g0","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm.lean#L62-L66","doc":"`tr(g₀) = z`: Markov stabilisation of the unit. ","signatureChunk":0}]}